  "sourceAudit": {
    "mechanism": "Standard-object common EED layer-name resolution used editable LAYER names without immutable consumed name-field/profile/decode evidence. Wide IDs must not bind low-word aliases.",
    "method": "Source audit and scratch-authored adversarial controls. No pre-fix executable production failure is claimed for these new evidence APIs."
  },
  "implemented": [
    "DRW_TableEntry provides one shared bounded APPID/LAYER name observer without new base storage or virtual callback. APPID evidence API remains unchanged.",
    "LAYER private shared-const owner retains exact consumed name-field bits/start/count, decoded name, source handle/version/codec and isolated issues under a512KiB logical-owner cap. Bound name eligibility requires fixed51 and complete declared TV/TU width.",
    "Name observation precedes CMC conversion; repeated prior issues and later color losses remain separately observed. Tolerant name/CMC values and wire layout are unchanged.",
    "Generation-keyed LAYER callback snapshots share64MiB/combined100000-record source caps with APPID/object owners. All three families reject same-generation handle collisions in either callback order.",
    "Common EED freezes sorted unique full64-bit layer dependencies; narrow actual source names/profile issues transfer into frame observations. Missing/null/wide/authored/unbound refs remain tolerant but unqualified, without low-word or hex-name guessing.",
    "Before-output/final-publication guards compare referenced mutable rows to immutable name owners. Name/proof/removal/duplicate mutations refuse atomically; restored sources permit same-adapter retries. Color-only edits do not certify or require full layer semantics.",
    "Native DWG-to-DXF controls assert exact1003 layer name, actual layer row, and no DWG raw replay metadata. Comparator still refuses layer-reference variants; no XRECORD modeled-output fact is added."
  ],
